        "en": "Longtime patrons previously trusted the salon for calm and gentle handling of sensitive dogs. However, several recent visitors reported distressed pets, cut skin near sensitive areas, and a bleeding dew claw clipped too close, prompting safety warnings from longtime neighborhood clients."
      }
